# The Expo application is self-contained in mobile/. The game runtime is
# delivered from EXPO_PUBLIC_GAME_URL, so source-generation media and web
# build artifacts must never enter an EAS archive.
# Keep the repository layout EAS expects for this monorepo, but exclude every
# web/CMS asset tree. The native shell downloads the published fight client.
.git/
.claude/
.cache/
.gstack/
admin/
api/
artifacts/
cms/
cms-data/
cms-data copy/
dist/
dist-fight/
docs/
generated/
node_modules/
public/
public copy/
scripts/
shared/
src/
tests/

mobile/node_modules/
mobile/.expo/
mobile/dist-native-check/
mobile/npm-debug.log*
mobile/*.log
mobile/.DS_Store
